<title>USA: Interim Services sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Interim Services sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interim Services Inc said on Thursday the company will effect a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend to stockholders of record as of the close of business on August 18, 1997, payable on September 5, 1997.</p>
</text>
